            class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5 xl:gap-6 items-stretch">

                                                                            <div class="card-item-wrapper h-full animate-fade-in" data-categorias="[&quot;plazas&quot;]">
                        <a href="https://descubre.veracruzmunicipio.gob.mx/CentroHistorico/lugares/zocalo" class="group bg-[#F4F0E9] rounded-[1.5rem] shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 flex flex-col h-full">
    <div class="relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden rounded-t-[1.5rem]">
        
        <img src="https://descubre.veracruzmunicipio.gob.mx/images/Centro_Historico/lugares/zocalo.jpg"
             data-ms-field="lugares.zocalo.image"             class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
            alt="Zócalo">
    </div>
    
    <div class="p-5 flex flex-col flex-grow justify-between gap-2">
        <div>
            <!-- Modificado: line-clamp-1 para que el título no salte a más de una línea si es largo -->
            <h3 class="text-[#5C113C] font-bold text-sm md:text-base tracking-wider uppercase fuente-titulos line-clamp-1">
                
                Zócalo
            </h3>
            
            <!-- Modificado: line-clamp-3 limita el texto a 3 líneas y pone los "..." -->
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-xs md:text-sm font-medium font-sans mt-1.5 leading-relaxed line-clamp-3">
                
                The vibrant heart of the port. A space full of life where the portales, the Cathedral, and the Municipal Palace converge. It is the ultimate gathering spot to enjoy danzón, marimba music, and the warmth of Veracruz locals under the shade of its traditional palm trees.
            </p>
        </div>
        
        <span class="text-[#B19657] group-hover:text-[#5C113C] font-bold text-[10px] md:text-xs tracking-wider uppercase flex items-center gap-1 transition-colors mt-2">
           LEARN MORE<span class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1 duration-300">→</span>
        </span>
    </div>
</a>                    </div>
                                                                                <div class="card-item-wrapper h-full animate-fade-in" data-categorias="[&quot;museos&quot;]">
                        <a href="https://descubre.veracruzmunicipio.gob.mx/CentroHistorico/lugares/san-juan-de-ulua" class="group bg-[#F4F0E9] rounded-[1.5rem] shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 flex flex-col h-full">
    <div class="relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden rounded-t-[1.5rem]">
        
        <img src="https://descubre.veracruzmunicipio.gob.mx/images/Centro_Historico/lugares/sanjuandeulua.png"
             data-ms-field="lugares.san-juan-de-ulua.image"             class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
            alt="San Juan de Ulúa">
    </div>
    
    <div class="p-5 flex flex-col flex-grow justify-between gap-2">
        <div>
            <!-- Modificado: line-clamp-1 para que el título no salte a más de una línea si es largo -->
            <h3 class="text-[#5C113C] font-bold text-sm md:text-base tracking-wider uppercase fuente-titulos line-clamp-1">
                
                San Juan de Ulúa
            </h3>
            
            <!-- Modificado: line-clamp-3 limita el texto a 3 líneas y pone los "..." -->
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-xs md:text-sm font-medium font-sans mt-1.5 leading-relaxed line-clamp-3">
                
                An imposing fortress built on a reef that served as a defensive bastion, a commercial port, and one of the most feared prisons in Mexico&#039;s history. Its coral walls tell tales of pirates, invasions, and colonial legends that shaped the destiny of the nation.
            </p>
        </div>
        
        <span class="text-[#B19657] group-hover:text-[#5C113C] font-bold text-[10px] md:text-xs tracking-wider uppercase flex items-center gap-1 transition-colors mt-2">
           LEARN MORE<span class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1 duration-300">→</span>
        </span>
    </div>
</a>                    </div>
                                                                                <div class="card-item-wrapper h-full animate-fade-in" data-categorias="[&quot;museos&quot;]">
                        <a href="https://descubre.veracruzmunicipio.gob.mx/CentroHistorico/lugares/museo-naval" class="group bg-[#F4F0E9] rounded-[1.5rem] shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 flex flex-col h-full">
    <div class="relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden rounded-t-[1.5rem]">
        
        <img src="https://descubre.veracruzmunicipio.gob.mx/images/Centro_Historico/lugares/museonaval.jpg"
             data-ms-field="lugares.museo-naval.image"             class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
            alt="Museo Naval México">
    </div>
    
    <div class="p-5 flex flex-col flex-grow justify-between gap-2">
        <div>
            <!-- Modificado: line-clamp-1 para que el título no salte a más de una línea si es largo -->
            <h3 class="text-[#5C113C] font-bold text-sm md:text-base tracking-wider uppercase fuente-titulos line-clamp-1">
                
                Museo Naval México
            </h3>
            
            <!-- Modificado: line-clamp-3 limita el texto a 3 líneas y pone los "..." -->
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-xs md:text-sm font-medium font-sans mt-1.5 leading-relaxed line-clamp-3">
                
                Located in the former building of the Naval Military School, this venue offers an interactive journey through Mexico&#039;s maritime history. It features more than 20 rooms exhibiting historical artifacts, scale models, and nautical technology, paying tribute to the heroes who defended the port.
            </p>
        </div>
        
        <span class="text-[#B19657] group-hover:text-[#5C113C] font-bold text-[10px] md:text-xs tracking-wider uppercase flex items-center gap-1 transition-colors mt-2">
           LEARN MORE<span class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1 duration-300">→</span>
        </span>
