</a>                    </div>
                                                                                <div class="card-item-wrapper h-full animate-fade-in" data-categorias="[&quot;museos&quot;]">
                        <a href="https://descubre.veracruzmunicipio.gob.mx/CentroHistorico/lugares/baluarte-santiago" class="group bg-[#F4F0E9] rounded-[1.5rem] shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 flex flex-col h-full">
    <div class="relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden rounded-t-[1.5rem]">
        
        <img src="https://descubre.veracruzmunicipio.gob.mx/images/Centro_Historico/lugares/baluarte.png"
             data-ms-field="lugares.baluarte-santiago.image"             class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
            alt="Baluarte de Santiago">
    </div>
    
    <div class="p-5 flex flex-col flex-grow justify-between gap-2">
        <div>
            <!-- Modificado: line-clamp-1 para que el título no salte a más de una línea si es largo -->
            <h3 class="text-[#5C113C] font-bold text-sm md:text-base tracking-wider uppercase fuente-titulos line-clamp-1">
                
                Baluarte de Santiago
            </h3>
            
            <!-- Modificado: line-clamp-3 limita el texto a 3 líneas y pone los "..." -->
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-xs md:text-sm font-medium font-sans mt-1.5 leading-relaxed line-clamp-3">
                
                The last survivor of the seven bastions that made up the city&#039;s defensive wall in the 17th century. Known as &quot;El polvorín&quot; (The Powder Magazine), this historical monument is a masterpiece of military architecture that today protects pre-Hispanic treasures and the walled memory of Veracruz.
            </p>
        </div>
        
        <span class="text-[#B19657] group-hover:text-[#5C113C] font-bold text-[10px] md:text-xs tracking-wider uppercase flex items-center gap-1 transition-colors mt-2">
           LEARN MORE<span class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1 duration-300">→</span>
        </span>
    </div>
</a>                    </div>
