                        <a href="https://descubre.veracruzmunicipio.gob.mx/CentroHistorico/lugares/casa-diaz-miron" class="group bg-[#F4F0E9] rounded-[1.5rem] shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 flex flex-col h-full">
    <div class="relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden rounded-t-[1.5rem]">
        
        <img src="https://descubre.veracruzmunicipio.gob.mx/images/Centro_Historico/museos/casadiaz.jpg"
             data-ms-field="lugares.casa-diaz-miron.image"             class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
            alt="Salvador Díaz Mirón House">
    </div>
    
    <div class="p-5 flex flex-col flex-grow justify-between gap-2">
        <div>
            <!-- Modificado: line-clamp-1 para que el título no salte a más de una línea si es largo -->
            <h3 class="text-[#5C113C] font-bold text-sm md:text-base tracking-wider uppercase fuente-titulos line-clamp-1">
                
                Salvador Díaz Mirón House
            </h3>
            
            <!-- Modificado: line-clamp-3 limita el texto a 3 líneas y pone los "..." -->
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-xs md:text-sm font-medium font-sans mt-1.5 leading-relaxed line-clamp-3">
                
                This museum was the residence of the Veracruz poet and journalist Salvador Díaz Mirón, one of the most important literary figures in 19th and early 20th-century Mexico. The property preserves furniture, documents, library, and personal objects of the writer. Díaz Mirón stood out for his modernist poetry and also for his intense political and journalistic activity. The house was transformed into a museum to preserve his literary legacy and show aspects of the intellectual life of Veracruz at that time. It is currently one of the most representative cultural museums in the historic center.
            </p>
        </div>
        
        <span class="text-[#B19657] group-hover:text-[#5C113C] font-bold text-[10px] md:text-xs tracking-wider uppercase flex items-center gap-1 transition-colors mt-2">
           LEARN MORE<span class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1 duration-300">→</span>
        </span>
    </div>
</a>                    </div>
