                        <a href="https://descubre.veracruzmunicipio.gob.mx/CentroHistorico/lugares/museo-de-la-ciudad" class="group bg-[#F4F0E9] rounded-[1.5rem] shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 flex flex-col h-full">
    <div class="relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden rounded-t-[1.5rem]">
        
        <img src="https://descubre.veracruzmunicipio.gob.mx/images/Centro_Historico/museos/museociudad.jpg"
             data-ms-field="lugares.museo-de-la-ciudad.image"             class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
            alt="Veracruz City Museum">
    </div>
    
    <div class="p-5 flex flex-col flex-grow justify-between gap-2">
        <div>
            <!-- Modificado: line-clamp-1 para que el título no salte a más de una línea si es largo -->
            <h3 class="text-[#5C113C] font-bold text-sm md:text-base tracking-wider uppercase fuente-titulos line-clamp-1">
                
                Veracruz City Museum
            </h3>
            
            <!-- Modificado: line-clamp-3 limita el texto a 3 líneas y pone los "..." -->
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-xs md:text-sm font-medium font-sans mt-1.5 leading-relaxed line-clamp-3">
                
                The City Museum of Veracruz, named in honor of Colonel Manuel Gutiérrez Zamora, is set in an old historical building in the center of the port. The site safeguards pieces, photographs, and documents related to the evolution of Veracruz from the colonial era to the present. Its rooms explain themes such as the foundation of the city, maritime trade, foreign invasions, the daily life of the port, and the urban development of the historic center. The museum also recognizes the importance of Manuel Gutiérrez Zamora, a liberal Veracruz politician and defender of the reformist ideas of the 19th century.
            </p>
        </div>
        
        <span class="text-[#B19657] group-hover:text-[#5C113C] font-bold text-[10px] md:text-xs tracking-wider uppercase flex items-center gap-1 transition-colors mt-2">
           LEARN MORE<span class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1 duration-300">→</span>
        </span>
    </div>
</a>                    </div>
