    <div class="relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden rounded-t-[1.5rem]">
        
        <img src="https://descubre.veracruzmunicipio.gob.mx/images/Centro_Historico/lugares/faro-carranza.png"
             data-ms-field="lugares.faro-carranza.image"             class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
            alt="Faro Venustiano Carranza">
    </div>
    
    <div class="p-5 flex flex-col flex-grow justify-between gap-2">
        <div>
            <!-- Modificado: line-clamp-1 para que el título no salte a más de una línea si es largo -->
            <h3 class="text-[#5C113C] font-bold text-sm md:text-base tracking-wider uppercase fuente-titulos line-clamp-1">
                
                Faro Venustiano Carranza
            </h3>
            
            <!-- Modificado: line-clamp-3 limita el texto a 3 líneas y pone los "..." -->
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-xs md:text-sm font-medium font-sans mt-1.5 leading-relaxed line-clamp-3">
                
                A majestic neoclassical style building inaugurated in 1910 by Porfirio Díaz to commemorate the centennial of Independence. With its iconic lighthouse and clock, this venue not only served as a marine guide but also functioned as the provisional headquarters of the Constitutionalist Government led by Venustiano Carranza in 1914. Its walls and courtyards are today a living emblem of the rich naval history and the revolutionary processes that forged contemporary Mexico.
            </p>
        </div>
        
        <span class="text-[#B19657] group-hover:text-[#5C113C] font-bold text-[10px] md:text-xs tracking-wider uppercase flex items-center gap-1 transition-colors mt-2">
           LEARN MORE<span class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1 duration-300">→</span>
        </span>
    </div>
</a>                    </div>
