            <!-- Modificado: line-clamp-3 limita el texto a 3 líneas y pone los "..." -->
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-xs md:text-sm font-medium font-sans mt-1.5 leading-relaxed line-clamp-3">
                
                It represents a woman with 2 children, one of whom seeks to feed from the mother&#039;s breast, and this gesture is assumed as an act of charity, feeding the helpless. On the site where the current registry is located, there was a hostel called San Charles, which collapsed to make way for the current building inaugurated in 1972.
            </p>
        </div>
        
        <span class="text-[#B19657] group-hover:text-[#5C113C] font-bold text-[10px] md:text-xs tracking-wider uppercase flex items-center gap-1 transition-colors mt-2">
