    <div class="relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden rounded-t-[1.5rem]">
        
        <img src="https://descubre.veracruzmunicipio.gob.mx/images/Centro_Historico/monumentos/tranvia.jpg"
             data-ms-field="lugares.tranvia-del-recuerdo.image"             class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
            alt="Tram of Remembrance">
    </div>
    
    <div class="p-5 flex flex-col flex-grow justify-between gap-2">
        <div>
            <!-- Modificado: line-clamp-1 para que el título no salte a más de una línea si es largo -->
            <h3 class="text-[#5C113C] font-bold text-sm md:text-base tracking-wider uppercase fuente-titulos line-clamp-1">
                
                Tram of Remembrance
            </h3>
            
            <!-- Modificado: line-clamp-3 limita el texto a 3 líneas y pone los "..." -->
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-xs md:text-sm font-medium font-sans mt-1.5 leading-relaxed line-clamp-3">
                
                The Tram of Remembrance is a historical and tourist monument that evokes the era when trams were an essential part of urban transport in Veracruz. During much of the 20th century, trams ran through the streets of the historic center and connected different areas of the city, becoming a daily symbol of port life. With the modernization of transport, this system disappeared, but one of the old cars was preserved as a tribute to that stage of Veracruz&#039;s urban development. Currently, the tram functions as a tangible reminder of the port&#039;s history and the transformation of its mobility and urban landscape.
            </p>
        </div>
        
        <span class="text-[#B19657] group-hover:text-[#5C113C] font-bold text-[10px] md:text-xs tracking-wider uppercase flex items-center gap-1 transition-colors mt-2">
           LEARN MORE<span class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1 duration-300">→</span>
        </span>
    </div>
</a>                    </div>
