                        <a href="https://descubre.veracruzmunicipio.gob.mx/CentroHistorico/lugares/faro-benito-juarez" class="group bg-[#F4F0E9] rounded-[1.5rem] shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 flex flex-col h-full">
    <div class="relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden rounded-t-[1.5rem]">
        
        <img src="https://descubre.veracruzmunicipio.gob.mx/images/Centro_Historico/lugares/farobenito.jpg"
             data-ms-field="lugares.faro-benito-juarez.image"             class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
            alt="San Francisco Convent (Benito Juárez Lighthouse)">
    </div>
    
    <div class="p-5 flex flex-col flex-grow justify-between gap-2">
        <div>
            <!-- Modificado: line-clamp-1 para que el título no salte a más de una línea si es largo -->
            <h3 class="text-[#5C113C] font-bold text-sm md:text-base tracking-wider uppercase fuente-titulos line-clamp-1">
                
                San Francisco Convent (Benito Juárez Lighthouse)
            </h3>
            
            <!-- Modificado: line-clamp-3 limita el texto a 3 líneas y pone los "..." -->
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-xs md:text-sm font-medium font-sans mt-1.5 leading-relaxed line-clamp-3">
                
                The former Convent of San Francisco, later known as the Benito Juárez Lighthouse and Reform Enclosure, is a paramount 16th-century historic monument. Its grand tower served as Veracruz&#039;s first lighthouse during the 19th century. Within these historic walls, President Benito Juárez enacted the monumental Reform Laws between 1859 and 1860, establishing the separation of Church and State in Mexico.
            </p>
        </div>
        
        <span class="text-[#B19657] group-hover:text-[#5C113C] font-bold text-[10px] md:text-xs tracking-wider uppercase flex items-center gap-1 transition-colors mt-2">
           LEARN MORE<span class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1 duration-300">→</span>
        </span>
    </div>
</a>                    </div>
